{"id":"662407","name":"盐焗猪肝瘦肉","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/662407/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肝","amount":"250g"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[{"name":"香叶","amount":"5g"},{"name":"八角","amount":"2颗"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"5g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪肝清洗干净后，用水加入料酒泡上20分钟。","img":"images/662407/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"泡好的猪肝捞出，加几块瘦肉。","img":"images/662407/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"砂锅里倒入食盐，放入花椒、八角、香叶。","img":"images/662407/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"食盐炒至转变黄色，盛出一半的食盐。","img":"images/662407/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把猪肝瘦肉放入锅内。","img":"images/662407/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"刚刚盛出的食盐盖入表面。","img":"images/662407/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盖上锅盖，小火焗20分钟，关火焖5分钟即可。","img":"images/662407/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"时间到，把肉表面的盐清理干净。","img":"images/662407/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品，切盘上桌。","img":"images/662407/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}